  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TBC Bank- Climate Financing Package</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFC anticipates that the Project will contribute towards efforts in Georgia to reduce the access to finance gap for SMEs and will support the Bank to grow its climate finance portfolio over based on its developing green ESG strategy.  IFC&apos;s funding will be used to grow the portfolio targeting renewable energy and energy efficient projects across the SME segment. IFC further anticipates that this investment will promote market sustainability by catalyzing the adoption of best practices in climate finance products, processes, and standards.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment to JSC TBC Bank (the Bank) comprises up to US$200 million or equivalent in EUR and/or GEL financing in the form of a senior loan with maturity of up to 5 years (the Project). The proceeds of the Project will be earmarked for financing small and medium enterprises (SMEs) with up to 40 percent of the proceeds dedicated to eligible renewable energy and energy-efficient climate projects.</narrative>
  </description>
